 and 1A PoE capability over 0..70C. OCL180uH at 25C/100kHz/0.1V has no specified DC bias; DCR1ohm maximum has no winding-balance tolerance, and 1A injection/test conditions are absent. The defined installation uses regulated nonisolated 50.4V maximum and a 0..70C component environment. Normal input RMS and cable/CT temperature limits are governed by the final whole-board power policy and its waveform contract; the limited fault and impulse envelopes are separate, not continuous ratings. Retain loaded-link, DC imbalance/bias, ripple, temperature-rise and fault first-article verification. No IEEE PoE/system-isolation or arbitrary-imbalance OCL guarantee is inferred. Final F78.6,85/0 uses the primary 24-land pattern and both-side logical channel reversals, preserving all eight standard J1 pin polarities without a PHY register swap. All MDI/cable/CT branches are reconstructed, fully routed and covered by the final joined-revision source/reference receipts. Factory assembly/CAM and powered Ethernet/current characterization remain release conditions." (id 5) (at 157.48 208.28 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left) hide)) (property "Manufacturer" "E-NETTR (Dongguan Xiangxing Electronics)" (id 6) (at 157.48 208.28 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left) hide)) (property "MPN" "H2414QR" (id 7) (at 157.48 208.28 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left) hide)) (pin "1" (uuid 9ec26e3c-343f-4f1c-8228-39002f505809)) (pin "2" (uuid 65f71c7e-06d6-42a0-b0f8-45ce0b6be644)) (pin "3" (uuid 94437a3a-c7af-41da-879d-1bf25132540c)) (pin "4" (uuid 92119c21-4595-493e-bc76-f6ca7303ab7f)) (pin "5" (uuid 29e89316-2f90-4506-af93-566c3ee2e22f)) (pin "6" (uuid 54d0b3f6-ceed-40c0-902a-a5c9ac905a76)) (pin "7" (uuid 0fd36a09-66b1-46b9-b2f8-3db626e73c08)) (pin "8" (uuid 60023eb6-a2a5-46e2-abe7-5718b00817c0)) (pin "9" (uuid 6c29f5ba-00ce-406c-8d39-2e59f3350a66)) (pin "10" (uuid 6685d2ab-e7f0-41f0-884d-71c5c5f750f3)) (pin "11" (uuid a3ae395b-fcc9-488e-bdcf-435a5c4b71fb))